  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020390,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "恋鐘姫、お気に召す部屋にはなったでしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020400,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……！\r\nみんな、ほんとにありがと～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020400"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020410,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……\r\nアナタが喜んでくださるなら、それで何よりの幸せです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020410"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020420,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──さあ恋鐘姫、お手をどうぞ\r\nエスコートいたしましょう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020420"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020430,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020430"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020440,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "姫？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020450,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今日のうちはお姫様……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020450"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020460,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、うちだけじゃなかとよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020470,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちも、摩美々も、結華も、霧子も──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020480,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "もっちろん咲耶も、\r\n今日はみ～んな、お姫様ばい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020490,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "お姫様に変身するためのもん……\r\nちゃんと持ってきとるよね～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020490"
  },
  {
