  {
    "id": 3006009020500,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "ふふ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020510,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "こうしていると……\r\n優雅な気持ちでございます……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020520,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今日はみんなでお姫様やけん、\r\n好きなだけのんびりしてよか……ですわ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020520"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020530,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "このような最高の休日を知ってしまっては……\r\n明日を迎えるのが悲しくなってしまいます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020530"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020540,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "きっと明日は明日のわたくしたちを満たす愉しみが\r\nございましょう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020540"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020550,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうでなくては、\r\nワガママなわたくしたちは飽いてしまいます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020550"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020560,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020560"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020570,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………\r\nご気分はいかがでしょう、摩美々姫",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020570"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020580,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020580"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020590,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……わたくしー\r\nマカロンが食べたい気分ですー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020590"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020600,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "まぁ……！\r\nそれは……優雅ですわ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020600"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020610,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "え、と……\r\nマカロンは……ございまして……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020610"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020620,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "シュークリームでしたら、うちの者が用意しておりますわ\r\n──どうかしら？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020620"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020630,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "シュークリームかぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020630"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006009020640,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……ま、それも悪くないかもねー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600902/3006009020640"
  },
